@@ -2,8 +2,12 @@
 
 A small ASP.NET Core (net8.0) minimal API for managing work items: create, list, update and
 delete tasks, each with a state (`Open`, `InProgress`, `Done`), a priority (`Low`, `Medium`,
-`High`) and timestamps. Storage is an in-memory store seeded with a few sample tasks; all
-`/tasks` routes require a bearer token.
+`High`), an optional due date and timestamps. Storage is an in-memory store seeded with a few
+sample tasks; all `/tasks` routes require a bearer token.
+
+`dueDate` is optional everywhere it appears. It can be set on `POST /tasks` and `PUT /tasks/{id}`,
+and is returned on every task - `null` when the task has no due date. Because `PUT` replaces the
+whole task, leaving `dueDate` out of an update clears any date already set.
 
